    "media:imagetext": "W\nE\nWe are pleased to present an array of fine California wines\ncarefully selected for their excellence by United's Cellar Committee\nunder the guidance of wine judge and author; Bob Thompson.\nYour Flight Attendant will inform you which wines are being offered today:\nCHAMPAGNE\nDomaine Chandon Napa Valley Brut\nCHARDONNAY\nBouchaine Napa Valley 1989 or St. Supéry Napa Valley 1991\nCABERNET SAUVIGNON\nSeghesio Sonoma County 1991 or Beaulieu Vineyard 1990\nMAI TAI\nblends a variety of Fruit Juices with Rum\nin a refreshing tropical Cocktail Drink\nN\nEnjoy a Snack\nwith your preferred Cocktail or Beverage.\nOur Garden Fresh Salad\noffers a colorful array\nof Radicchio and Romaine Lettuce\ntopped with Red Bell Pepper and sprinkled with toasted Almonds.\nSelect from Javanese or Honey Dijon Dressing.\n1603-1\nM\nA\nN\nCOURSES\n• • •\nFilet Mignon\nis a Tenderloin of Beef accompanied by a Sauce\nprepared with Shiitake Mushrooms, Chardonnay Wine, fresh Ginger and Wasabi.\nA Four Grain Pilaf with Herbs and a stir-fried Vegetable Medley\nenhance your meal.\nSeafood Brochette\ncombines Shrimp and Swordfish\nwith Bell Pepper, Onion and Zucchini in a Cilantro Marinade.\nA Pilaf of Saffron Rice mixed with Mung Beans accompanies your Entree.\nPan-Seared Breast of Chicken\nis complemented by a Sauce that combines\nsautéed Shiitake Mushrooms, fresh Ginger and Wasabi.\nA Four Grain Pilaf and a Vegetable Medley complete this selection.\nN\nD\nF\nTE\nR\nA\nIce Cream Sundae Cart\nfeatures BEN\u0026JERRY'S. Vanilla and Coffee Ice Cream.\nelds.\nCookies warm from the oven\nThe Finishing Touch\nwe recommend is 100% Colombian Coffee.\n1603-1\nLD31\n200|.080./30",
